<!-- HOW I WORK -->
<section class="bg-accent py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
    <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-4 md:gap-8">
      <div class="w-full" style="max-width: 270px">
        {% include "leverage-expertise.njk" %}
      </div>
      <div class="w-20 md:w-22">{% include "elephant.njk" %}</div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="mb-2">Leveraging your expertise</h2>
    <p>
      You know your markets. You know your people. And you know your
      organization. Given plenty of time, you will solve your challenges. But
      time is scarce. Allow me to leverage your expertise and save you trial and
      error.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-6">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1">Visualization</h3>
        <p>
          Visualization makes your thoughts tangible. It helps you to see the
          patterns and reduce complexity to a manageable level. With it, you can
          shift perspective and ask new questions. It helps you to see the
          elephants in your meeting room.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1">Intervention Design</h3>
        <p>
          There is a place for standard, big interventions. But often, these are
          more comfort of having acted than a real solution. Instead, I design
          and execute minimally invasive interventions. Quite a few of those
          remove something instead of adding. They are designed to work with
          your bottlenecks, not against them.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
